ite Mine (a donated mine in those mountains) would violate the statement that \"no Texas mountain ranges have donated mines.\"  \n   - Therefore, the Picuris Mountains **cannot** be in Texas. They must be in New Mexico.  \n\n3. **Answer to the Question:**  \n   Since the Picuris Mountains (visited by Juan de Onate) are in New Mexico, the statement \"Juan de Onate visited a mountain range in Texas\" is **false**.  \n\n**Answer:** B) False",
