nk>\n\nA) True\n\nThe context explicitly states that Ailton Silva was loaned out to Braga. Additionally, it clarifies that \"Nautico is a football club along with Braga,\" confirming Braga's status as a football club. Therefore, the statement \"Ailton Silva was loaned out to a football club\" is **true**. The mention of Fluminense as another football club is irrelevant to this specific claim. The key details directly support the loan occurring between Ailton and a football club (Braga).",
