e capital of South Dakota, so that\'s consistent.The fifth point says any city in Butte is not in Pierre.Wait, that wording is a bit confusing."Any city in Butte" – but Butte is a city, not a state.Maybe it\'s a translation issue?It\'s clear that Butte and Pierre are in the same state, and Missoula is not in Montana. White Sulphur Springs is definitely not in the same state as Butte.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
