 TX cannot have such mines).  \n5. Therefore, the Picuris Mountains must be in **New Mexico**, making the mine located in an NM mountain range.  \n6. The question asks if the statement *\"The Harding Pegmatite Mine is not located in a mountain range in New Mexico\"* is true.  \n   - Since the mine **is** in NM's Picuris Mountains, the statement is **false**.  \n\n**Answer:** B) False",
